{"item": "cv02", "show": "dbza", "youtube": "j2Y0VqeKxyg", "title": "Cell Vs Yami Yugi", "duration": 141, "lines": [{"i": 0, "start": 2.06, "end": 3.06, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "Perfect Cell!"}, {"i": 1, "start": 3.06, "end": 3.6, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "Zzzzz--"}, {"i": 2, "start": 3.6, "end": 5.34, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "Oh, wha-mm-wha-who, what?"}, {"i": 3, "start": 5.34, "end": 7.12, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "I've come to duel you!"}, {"i": 4, "start": 7.12, "end": 8.76, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "And end this madness!"}, {"i": 5, "start": 8.76, "end": 13.08, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "Good Lord, with hair like that, I bet you've never lost a game of \"Who's the Protag?\"."}, {"i": 6, "start": 14.0, "end": 16.38, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "I hail from ancient Egypt."}, {"i": 7, "start": 16.38, "end": 20.14, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "A long since buried Pharaoh, I once ruled over the land..."}, {"i": 8, "start": 20.14, "end": 24.72, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "Commanding magicians; dragons; the very ground beneath your feet!"}, {"i": 9, "start": 24.84, "end": 28.04, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "Alright! I'm actually getting a little excited now!"}, {"i": 10, "start": 28.4, "end": 30.84, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "I was unrivaled in my time."}, {"i": 11, "start": 30.84, "end": 34.34, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "And now I stand here in modern day as King!"}, {"i": 12, "start": 34.34, "end": 36.32, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "So, Perfect Cell..."}, {"i": 13, "start": 36.32, "end": 38.7, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "Do you accept my challenge?"}, {"i": 14, "start": 38.7, "end": 42.38, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "Or do you bow to the whims of my majesty?"}, {"i": 15, "start": 42.38, "end": 45.02, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "Finally; someone who *gets it*!"}, {"i": 16, "start": 45.02, "end": 48.78, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "Ebb forth your divine Providence, mighty Pharaoh!"}, {"i": 17, "start": 48.78, "end": 51.92, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "And let us upheave the land with our *battle*!"}, {"i": 18, "start": 51.92, "end": 53.26, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "Then it's time..."}, {"i": 19, "start": 53.26, "end": 56.78, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "...to d-d-d-d- d-d-d-d-d-d-d-d-d-d-duel!"}, {"i": 20, "start": 57.6, "end": 59.62, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "Wh-- ...Where's your deck?"}, {"i": 21, "start": 59.62, "end": 62.1, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "My d-d-d-d- d-d-d-d-deck?"}, {"i": 22, "start": 62.1, "end": 63.64, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "Yes; your deck!"}, {"i": 23, "start": 63.64, "end": 65.7, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "Also, the hologram projectors!"}, {"i": 24, "start": 65.7, "end": 67.26, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "What, are we gonna do this analog?"}, {"i": 25, "start": 67.26, "end": 70.2, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "Because I mean I can, but we're gonna have to get a little closer."}, {"i": 26, "start": 70.64, "end": 71.86, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "Is this a prank?"}, {"i": 27, "start": 72.16, "end": 74.68, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "Which one is it? Ashton or Jamie?"}, {"i": 28, "start": 74.68, "end": 77.72, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "Oh, please, don't tell me it's Bam Margera..."}, {"i": 29, "start": 77.8, "end": 79.72, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "I'm trying to duel you!"}, {"i": 30, "start": 79.98, "end": 81.32, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "In Duel Monsters..."}, {"i": 31, "start": 81.5, "end": 83.7, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "\"Duel... Monsters\"?"}, {"i": 32, "start": 83.9, "end": 85.9, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "It's a children's card game!"}, {"i": 33, "start": 85.9, "end": 87.32, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "Ancient Egyptians loved it!"}, {"i": 34, "start": 87.32, "end": 88.8, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "F***, I'm down! How do we play?"}, {"i": 35, "start": 90.42, "end": 93.34, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "What do you mean, I can't use Monster Reborn!?"}, {"i": 36, "start": 93.6, "end": 95.56, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "Yup, right here, the rulebook you gave me:"}, {"i": 37, "start": 95.56, "end": 98.56, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "\"Monster Reborn has been tournament illegal since 2004.\""}, {"i": 38, "start": 98.56, "end": 102.56, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "I mean, it's been off and on since then, but it's... it's currently forbidden, so..."}, {"i": 39, "start": 102.56, "end": 104.56, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "But this isn't a tournament...!"}, {"i": 40, "start": 104.56, "end": 105.28, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "Isn't it?"}, {"i": 41, "start": 105.82, "end": 106.6, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "Is it not?"}, {"i": 42, "start": 107.38, "end": 108.18, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "Fine."}, {"i": 43, "start": 108.18, "end": 110.32, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "Then I play Pot of Greed!"}, {"i": 44, "start": 110.32, "end": 111.32, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "Also banned!"}, {"i": 45, "start": 111.32, "end": 111.88, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "What?!"}, {"i": 46, "start": 111.88, "end": 112.86, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "2005."}, {"i": 47, "start": 112.86, "end": 114.2, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "Then Brain Control!"}, {"i": 48, "start": 114.56, "end": 115.66, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "2010~!"}, {"i": 49, "start": 115.66, "end": 116.82, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "Slifer the Sky--!"}, {"i": 50, "start": 116.82, "end": 118.62, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "Oh, come on! All God cards are banned."}, {"i": 51, "start": 118.62, "end": 119.44, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "F*** you!"}, {"i": 52, "start": 119.44, "end": 122.04, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "Also it's *eight* thousand life points, not four."}, {"i": 53, "start": 122.04, "end": 123.2, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "No idea where you got that from."}, {"i": 54, "start": 123.7, "end": 125.12, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "You're full of shit!"}, {"i": 55, "start": 125.12, "end": 129.4, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Yami", "text": "I'm taking my Millennium Puzzle and teenage boy's body and going home!"}, {"i": 56, "start": 129.5, "end": 132.76, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "Also, it's cheating to have someone else help you during a game. Byeee~!"}, {"i": 57, "start": 133.3, "end": 136.24, "kind": "dialog", "speaker": "Cell", "text": "That's a deep voice for a 14-year-old, my God (!)"}], "segments": []}